(7297202, 1138026, 118154, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top picks this challenge, the realism, point of view and mono all going toward that .</td>', 'This is one of my top picks this challenge, the realism, point of view and mono all going toward that .', '2014-12-31 12:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
