(7297242, 1138050, 24073, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image, my favorite so far in this challenge.  The one big problem with it, is the DNMC that I''m sure you have been told about already.  I love it, and I can almost see some play in it if I look real hard, but the colors, and the composition do not say play to me at all.  Although I love it, and would hang this photo on my wall in a second, I don''t feel ''Play" is profound enough to really meet the challenge adequately.</td>', 'I absolutely love this image, my favorite so far in this challenge.  The one big problem with it, is the DNMC that I''m sure you have been told about already.  I love it, and I can almost see some play in it if I look real hard, but the colors, and the composition do not say play to me at all.  Although I love it, and would hang this photo on my wall in a second, I don''t feel ''Play" is profound enough to really meet the challenge adequately.', '2014-12-31 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
