(7297961, 1137916, 177553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and captured well.  I like that the shot doesn''t look staged.</td>', 'Nice shot and captured well.  I like that the shot doesn''t look staged.', '2015-01-02 12:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297962, 1137942, 177553, '<td valign="top">Sort of captures the challenge, but only with the title.  The shot itself is nice.  The ice crystals look awesome.</td>', 'Sort of captures the challenge, but only with the title.  The shot itself is nice.  The ice crystals look awesome.', '2015-01-02 12:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297964, 1138066, 177553, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here but the background is really distracting to me.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I like the idea here but the background is really distracting to me.  Meets the challenge well.', '2015-01-02 12:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297967, 1138026, 177553, '<td valign="top">Without the title, they just look kind of bored. They could just as easily be texting. Just my opinion.  Other than that, the capture itself is done well and I like the BW shot.</td>', 'Without the title, they just look kind of bored. They could just as easily be texting. Just my opinion.  Other than that, the capture itself is done well and I like the BW shot.', '2015-01-02 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297972, 1138069, 177553, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot and a good idea, but maybe color would have added more interest to it?  In itself I have a hard time seeing whats really going on...</td>', 'Not a bad shot and a good idea, but maybe color would have added more interest to it?  In itself I have a hard time seeing whats really going on...', '2015-01-02 12:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297973, 1138123, 177553, '<td valign="top">Its a toy, but that doesn''t really convey "play" in itself.  The shot isn''t bad, but maybe more DOF capturing the front prop in focus as well?  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Its a toy, but that doesn''t really convey "play" in itself.  The shot isn''t bad, but maybe more DOF capturing the front prop in focus as well?  Just my opinion.', '2015-01-02 12:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297974, 1138017, 177553, '<td valign="top">Kind of play, but the idea isn''t really present without the title.  Beautiful capture of the boats.  Looks like it may be a bit over sharpened?</td>', 'Kind of play, but the idea isn''t really present without the title.  Beautiful capture of the boats.  Looks like it may be a bit over sharpened?', '2015-01-02 12:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297977, 1137844, 177553, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. I like the focus that''s on the woman and how she''s almost hopping around.  It''s initially hard to see that she is in the midst of sculptures.  The background is pretty blown out, but maybe that''s intentional.  Either way, nice job.</td>', 'Interesting capture. I like the focus that''s on the woman and how she''s almost hopping around.  It''s initially hard to see that she is in the midst of sculptures.  The background is pretty blown out, but maybe that''s intentional.  Either way, nice job.', '2015-01-02 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297978, 1137768, 177553, '<td valign="top">Very grainy.  Not sure if that was intentional or if you had a high iso and this is the result of noise.  The shot doesn''t necessarily convey "play" to me, but Christmas.  Very colorful, which I do like.</td>', 'Very grainy.  Not sure if that was intentional or if you had a high iso and this is the result of noise.  The shot doesn''t necessarily convey "play" to me, but Christmas.  Very colorful, which I do like.', '2015-01-02 13:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297979, 1138050, 177553, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and difficult to look at, but that''s just me.  I don''t see "play" in my opinion although its hard to tell.  The shot is interesting though.</td>', 'Very abstract and difficult to look at, but that''s just me.  I don''t see "play" in my opinion although its hard to tell.  The shot is interesting though.', '2015-01-02 13:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297980, 1138100, 177553, '<td valign="top">The shot conveys "play" well, but very stark and high contrast.  Probably difficult to capture the white keys and the black plastic equally well.  Might have been better with more of a body shot in my opinion.</td>', 'The shot conveys "play" well, but very stark and high contrast.  Probably difficult to capture the white keys and the black plastic equally well.  Might have been better with more of a body shot in my opinion.', '2015-01-02 13:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297981, 1138077, 177553, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  Focus is good, but without the title it doesn''t convey "play" to me as much as it could.  Maybe a shot with the bike coming at you to reveal more of the face and a possible smile?</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  Focus is good, but without the title it doesn''t convey "play" to me as much as it could.  Maybe a shot with the bike coming at you to reveal more of the face and a possible smile?', '2015-01-02 13:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297983, 1138105, 177553, '<td valign="top">The shot is very distracting to me.  In my opinion, the BW doesn''t work well here.  Its hard to pick out many of the details here.  I do like the vignette.  Is that the lens hood?</td>', 'The shot is very distracting to me.  In my opinion, the BW doesn''t work well here.  Its hard to pick out many of the details here.  I do like the vignette.  Is that the lens hood?', '2015-01-02 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297985, 1137969, 177553, '<td valign="top">Cute, just cute.  Especially like the drool seeping out. Lol. Curious how this would have looked BW?</td>', 'Cute, just cute.  Especially like the drool seeping out. Lol. Curious how this would have looked BW?', '2015-01-02 13:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297987, 1138083, 177553, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, and well captured.  Lot of color which is nice in this instance.  The idea of "play" is missing out a lot here. Might be careful with the headless fellows at the top as well.  :)</td>', 'Cute idea, and well captured.  Lot of color which is nice in this instance.  The idea of "play" is missing out a lot here. Might be careful with the headless fellows at the top as well.  :)', '2015-01-02 13:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297988, 1138142, 177553, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I really like the clarity of the eye on this.</td>', 'Nice capture. I really like the clarity of the eye on this.', '2015-01-02 13:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297989, 1138081, 177553, '<td valign="top">Cool capture.  "Play" is portrayed well in my opinion.  The shot is almost a memory in itself.</td>', 'Cool capture.  "Play" is portrayed well in my opinion.  The shot is almost a memory in itself.', '2015-01-02 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297992, 1137947, 177553, '<td valign="top">Lol, cute shot.</td>', 'Lol, cute shot.', '2015-01-02 13:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297993, 1138121, 177553, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.  Those ghosty images can be hard to get.</td>', 'Interesting capture.  Those ghosty images can be hard to get.', '2015-01-02 13:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297994, 1138086, 177553, '<td valign="top">I see the shot as a little busy and distracting.  Interesting post processing though. A loss of color in the highlights and shadows.</td>', 'I see the shot as a little busy and distracting.  Interesting post processing though. A loss of color in the highlights and shadows.', '2015-01-02 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297995, 1138106, 177553, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the DOF in this and the focus is spot on for the fretting hand.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the DOF in this and the focus is spot on for the fretting hand.', '2015-01-02 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297996, 1137778, 177553, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but there are some color issues on the pieces with a lot of banding.  I suspect its from post processing.</td>', 'Cute idea, but there are some color issues on the pieces with a lot of banding.  I suspect its from post processing.', '2015-01-02 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297997, 1137867, 177553, '<td valign="top">This shot is cute, but I think it could have been better from a different angle or lighting.  The dogs face is hidden in shadow, which isn''t easy here without blowing out other areas of the capture.  Maybe shooting the subject somewhere other than the center of the frame could have also helped?  Just my opinion.</td>', 'This shot is cute, but I think it could have been better from a different angle or lighting.  The dogs face is hidden in shadow, which isn''t easy here without blowing out other areas of the capture.  Maybe shooting the subject somewhere other than the center of the frame could have also helped?  Just my opinion.', '2015-01-02 13:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297998, 1137891, 177553, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot at all, but I would have liked the object of his attention to be in focus as well. The face shows concentration so maybe bringing what he is playing with into focus could help improve the shot?  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Not a bad shot at all, but I would have liked the object of his attention to be in focus as well. The face shows concentration so maybe bringing what he is playing with into focus could help improve the shot?  Just my opinion.', '2015-01-02 13:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7297999, 1138144, 177553, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the backlighting and the BW image.  How would this look with the backlight hidden behind the hand completely?</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the backlighting and the BW image.  How would this look with the backlight hidden behind the hand completely?', '2015-01-02 13:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298000, 1138096, 177553, '<td valign="top">Lol, just cute!</td>', 'Lol, just cute!', '2015-01-02 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
