(7299754, 1138058, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice exercise in lighting, you made it look easy.</td>', 'Nice exercise in lighting, you made it look easy.', '2015-01-07 09:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299755, 1137768, 12611, '<td valign="top">An overexposed imperfect crazy angled grainy shot- full of realness that some other staged shots can''t must. this speaks to me of cabin fever, of testing and learning. All in all a success, and not bad at all for a brown!</td>', 'An overexposed imperfect crazy angled grainy shot- full of realness that some other staged shots can''t must. this speaks to me of cabin fever, of testing and learning. All in all a success, and not bad at all for a brown!', '2015-01-07 09:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299756, 1138105, 12611, '<td valign="top">I have one of those fish eye type lenses that you put on the end of any other lens, and you get the corner darkness and warp. I like the imperfections here, or at least generally perceived imperfections, and see them as a source of strength; the lens dust, the tilt, noise, grain and grayed-out tones- they all work together to create a real moment, and staged moment, echoing theme-</td>', 'I have one of those fish eye type lenses that you put on the end of any other lens, and you get the corner darkness and warp. I like the imperfections here, or at least generally perceived imperfections, and see them as a source of strength; the lens dust, the tilt, noise, grain and grayed-out tones- they all work together to create a real moment, and staged moment, echoing theme-', '2015-01-07 09:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299757, 1137869, 12611, '<td valign="top">Forget the challenge-Love the expressions.</td>', 'Forget the challenge-Love the expressions.', '2015-01-07 09:34:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299758, 1137941, 12611, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors to view as the stained-glass hummingbird pays a visit...</td>', 'wonderful colors to view as the stained-glass hummingbird pays a visit...', '2015-01-07 09:35:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299760, 1137738, 12611, '<td valign="top">One of the best I have seen in a while.<br/> <br/>It strikes me as a black and white impressionist painting,left up to interpretation, and I am ashamed to list the Rorschach results for me: The turkey faced clown is put in a headlock and slapped. The scary face winces as the haloed priestess swings.</td>', 'One of the best I have seen in a while. It strikes me as a black and white impressionist painting,left up to interpretation, and I am ashamed to list the Rorschach results for me: The turkey faced clown is put in a headlock and slapped. The scary face winces as the haloed priestess swings.', '2015-01-07 09:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299763, 1137768, 77196, '<td valign="top">Hey! First entry! Welcome to dpc! <br/>This is a great place to explore and learn. Some of us (er... me) learn a bit slower than others, but...<br/>Some suggestions on your entry:<br/>As others mentioned, this is very grainy - which is OK if it was intentional and serves an important role in the image. It it does in this image, it is not obvious to the observer.<br/>Crop - I find the light fixture in the hall distracting - it draws attention to itself, but does not appear to serve a purpose in the image. You probably could crop in a bit more on the right - enough to lose the light fixture - without hurting the image.<br/>Great - the two ornaments, red with gold swirl lines and the plain gold one provide a strong focal point for the image, as well as a nice contrast to each other. <br/>Don''t worry too much about the score. This is a tough shot, probably in very low light - a challenge in anyone''s book.</td>', 'Hey! First entry! Welcome to dpc! This is a great place to explore and learn. Some of us (er... me) learn a bit slower than others, but...Some suggestions on your entry:As others mentioned, this is very grainy - which is OK if it was intentional and serves an important role in the image. It it does in this image, it is not obvious to the observer.Crop - I find the light fixture in the hall distracting - it draws attention to itself, but does not appear to serve a purpose in the image. You probably could crop in a bit more on the right - enough to lose the light fixture - without hurting the image.Great - the two ornaments, red with gold swirl lines and the plain gold one provide a strong focal point for the image, as well as a nice contrast to each other. Don''t worry too much about the score. This is a tough shot, probably in very low light - a challenge in anyone''s book.', '2015-01-07 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7299799, 1138124, 174999, '<td valign="top">this was one of my favorites, well done!</td>', 'this was one of my favorites, well done!', '2015-01-07 11:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
